sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Operator
    participant SPA as Blazor SPA
    participant API as Minimal API
    participant EXEC as DuelExecutionService
    participant PX as Inference proxy
    participant HUB as DuelHub
    participant ST as Table + Blob
    participant J as AutoJudge

    U->>SPA: Submit prompt + 2 models (Home)
    SPA->>API: POST /api/duels (cookie)
    API->>ST: Create Duel (Pending)
    API-->>SPA: 202 Accepted + duelId
    SPA->>SPA: Navigate /arena/{duelId}
    SPA->>HUB: JoinDuel(duelId)
    API->>EXEC: EnqueueAsync → BackgroundTaskQueue

    par Left model
        EXEC->>PX: RunInferenceAsync
        PX-->>EXEC: SSE token chunks
        EXEC->>HUB: ModelStatusUpdate (Generating)
    and Right model (browser)
        EXEC->>HUB: StartLocalInference
        HUB-->>SPA: run WebLLM in worker
        SPA->>API: POST /{id}/local-result
        API->>ST: Save DuelResult
    end

    EXEC->>ST: Save both DuelResults
    EXEC->>HUB: DuelComplete
    HUB-->>SPA: swap to verdict UI

    alt Human picks inside AiJudge:DelaySeconds
        U->>API: POST /{id}/verdict
    else Grace window elapses
        J->>J: Wait DelaySeconds, re-read duel
        J->>API: Judge decides (A / B / Tie)
    end
    API->>ST: RecordVerdictHandler → Elo + EloHistory
    API->>HUB: VerdictRecorded + lobby event
